# Root-level ignore rules for the MOVEONE repository.
# These also cover the nested cre8x-transport-2100/ app.

# Dependencies, generated output and caches
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/coverage/
**/.vite/
**/.vercel/

# Sensitive local configuration (commit a documented example instead)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Private key and certificate formats
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519

# OS and IDE files
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/extensions.json

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
